{
 "_doc": [
  "Pop-Up Cafe: the museum's timed event area (Idle Bank Tycoon's event cafe).",
  "While the event is live, each station earns cafe coins every second, offline",
  "too (up to offline_cap_hours). Coins buy station levels; every level bought",
  "is a star, and stars climb the reward track. Income per station is",
  "base_income x level x milestone_mult^(level / milestone_every); a level costs",
  "base_cost x growth^(level-1) (open_cost opens a closed station). Coins and",
  "levels reset each event. The cafe is themed after the museum the player is",
  "in when the event starts; `palette` recolours the c_* role materials of the",
  "art3d/cafe kit (tools/blender/toybox/cafe.py). Pacing: about 130-170 stars in",
  "the first hours and 240-255 by the end for any player who checks in twice a",
  "day or more (tools: simulate before changing growth).",
  "`seasons`: an event that starts inside a season's from/to window (MM-DD, local date; it may wrap the new year) keeps the museum's caf\u00e9 but takes the season's name, stations, palette and `weather` (falling snow, petals, confetti or leaves)."
 ],
